Z||000000||hugh||08-12-2000||10:34 PM||||Mine is the best.That was the feeling I had when I first started to follow this forum.I've since learned that that mine is the best--to me.The same way everyone else's is the best to them.I have seen some truly beautiful cars on this site.I've lost some of the ambition(and energy) I had a few years ago or I would start another project car,like a longitude turbo V6 Buick.I didn't build my car and that bothers me.I can only refine it and correct the problems it has.I'm like everyone else,I want my car to be a reflection of me,so I have no choice but to make changes even if they can't be seen.Just to satisfy my ego and be able to say "That's my car" .I'll stop rambling now. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hugh_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
